WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.963
Here's what you'll be able to
do by the end of this module.

2
00:00:02.963 --> 00:00:07.186
You'll explain what the compliant
network check denies at authentication,

3
00:00:07.186 --> 00:00:09.162
and what it denies in near real time.

4
00:00:09.162 --> 00:00:11.903
You'll create the pilot
policy in report-only,

5
00:00:11.903 --> 00:00:16.274
with the emergency access group and
the Intune applications excluded.

6
00:00:16.274 --> 00:00:20.360
You'll list the five failure modes
and the design response to each,

7
00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:22.100
including a service outage.

8
00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:25.639
You'll turn on universal tenant
restrictions after the tenant

9
00:00:25.639 --> 00:00:29.587
restrictions version two policy, and
say which data planes it reaches.

10
00:00:29.587 --> 00:00:33.000
And you'll run Learn's four-case
test and read the block log.

11
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:37.639
You need Module 2, with the Microsoft
traffic profile and signaling on,

12
00:00:37.639 --> 00:00:42.438
and Access and Privilege, appendix C,
for the tenant restrictions policy.

13
00:00:42.438 --> 00:00:45.650
The lab runs in a test
tenant, never production.
